{"id":"b16c13e741889b14","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-system-comparison.md","title":"Proof System Comparison / p-simulation","display":"df-proof-system-comparison — Proof System Comparison / p-simulation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-system-comparison","aliases":["72-df-proof-system-comparison"],"display":"df-proof-system-comparison — Proof System Comparison / p-simulation","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 2.4; printed p. 552; PDF p. 564","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","revision_2026_10_22":"补出长度模拟和p模拟的反身传递性质及其方向"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-system-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-system-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-system-comparison — Proof System Comparison / p-simulation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 2.4; printed p. 552; PDF p. 564"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补出长度模拟和p模拟的反身传递性质及其方向"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 及总函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FP}\">\\(\\mathrm{FP}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" href=\"?note=d9d13f2ac55f5a6d\" title=\"72-df-propositional-proof-system\">72-df-propositional-proof-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N[X]\">\\(\\mathbb N[X]\\)</span> 为非负整数系数的一元多项式集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\pi|\">\\(|\\pi|\\)</span> 为串长。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}},\\leq_p,\\equiv_p,&lt;_p\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}},\\leq_p,\\equiv_p,&lt;_p\\)</span> 是 Assertion 定义的系统比较关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是另一个满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(S)\\)</span> 的总串函数；新增比较始终使用同一公式编码与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FP}\">\\(\\mathrm{FP}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(P(\\rho)=Q(\\pi)\\land|\\rho|\\leq b(|\\pi|)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb N[X]\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(P(\\rho)=Q(\\pi)\\land|\\rho|\\leq b(|\\pi|)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\leq_pP\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(f(\\pi))=Q(\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\leq_pP\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\exists f\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\;\\forall\\pi\\in\\Sigma^*\\;P(f(\\pi))=Q(\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\equiv_pQ\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;P\\leq_pQ\\land Q\\leq_pP,\\qquad\nP&lt;_pQ\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;P\\leq_pQ\\land\\neg(Q\\leq_pP).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\equiv_pQ\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;P\\leq_pQ\\land Q\\leq_pP,\\qquad\nP&lt;_pQ\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;P\\leq_pQ\\land\\neg(Q\\leq_pP).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\leq_pP\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\leq_pP\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;Q\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P\\leq_{\\rm sim}P\\land P\\leq_pP.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P\\leq_{\\rm sim}P\\land P\\leq_pP.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\leq_{\\rm sim}Q\\land Q\\leq_{\\rm sim}P\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ S\\leq_{\\rm sim}P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\leq_{\\rm sim}Q\\land Q\\leq_{\\rm sim}P\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ S\\leq_{\\rm sim}P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\leq_pQ\\land Q\\leq_pP\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ S\\leq_pP.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\leq_pQ\\land Q\\leq_pP\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ S\\leq_pP.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：Chapter VIII，§2.4，印刷页 552，PDF 页 564。原书分别讨论多项式大小界与能在多项式时间内构造对应证明的情形；此处分别记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathrm{sim}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_p\">\\(\\leq_p\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>最后一式是本地直接推论：多项式时间计算的输出长度由计算时间的多项式界控制。未把大小界反推为有效转换。</li>\n<li>No strict Frege-versus-extended-Frege comparison is asserted; such a separation is not supplied by the definition.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>反身性取同一证明、大小界b(n)=n和恒等转换。长度模拟的两个多项式界复合，且非负系数保证单调，因而得到多项式长度界；两个p模拟的转换函数直接复合，多项式时间函数对复合封闭。比较方向仍为右侧系统模拟左侧系统，不能因记号≤倒转。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)$，$\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(Q)$，$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$ 及总函数类 $\\mathrm{FP}$ 如 [[72-df-propositional-proof-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"te